<http://data.silknow.org/object/d9e41bbf-b41a-3975-8a55-698a57ed31ed>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "This design of this embroidery belongs to Group 3 as defined by Jennifer Wearden in 'Azerbaijanian Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts' in Hali Issue 59, October 1991 pp. 102-111.  Group 3 textiles are characterised by  surface darning on the diagonal; this is not on the diagonal."@en ;
        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/4c52fb36-5021-359f-9560-85740e530c81> ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/information/bibliography> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "This design of this embroidery belongs to Group 3 as defined by Jennifer Wearden in 'Azerbaijanian Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts' in Hali Issue 59, October 1991 pp. 102-111.  Group 3 textiles are characterised by  surface darning on the diagonal; this is not on the diagonal."@en .

